SUMMARY:Swoon Squad: A Romance TBR Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Swoon Squad is a romance-centered book club with a twist. Inste
 ad of everyone reading the same assigned title\, we choose a monthly trope
  and invite you to pick any book that fits the theme! Whether you're into 
 sweet contemporary rom-coms\, high-heat historical reads\, or paranormal r
 omance\, there's a seat for you at our table! How it Works: Pick Your Own 
 Adventure: We announce the month's trope\, and you choose a book from your
  own TBR pile or the library shelves that features it. Low Pressure\, High
  Fun: No more scrambling to finish a specific book you might not even like
 . Read at your own pace and bring your honest thoughts! The Discussion: We
  gather to swap recommendations\, vent about our favorite (and least favor
 ite) clichés\, and discover new authors through each other's picks. Come 
 ready to share your pick\, discuss the tropes\, and meet fellow romance fa
 ns in a comfortable library setting ❤️ June 29 - ⚔️Enemies to Love
 rs ⚔️ July 27 - 🥰😠Grumpy/Sunshine😠🥰 August 31 - 🏆Sports
  Romance🏆 September 28 - 📖Academic Romance📖 October 26 - 🧛Para
 normal Romance🧛 November 30 - 🛏️Forced Proximity🛏️ December 2
 8 - 🎁Holiday Romance🎁\n\nPrice: Free\n\nSchedule listed: Mon\, Dec 2
 8\, 2026 06:00 PM EST – Mon\, Dec 28\, 2026 08:00 PM EST\n\nSchedule sup
 plied by Lancaster Libraries\n\nTimes converted from America/New_York to U
 TC for calendar compatibility.\n\nRegistration: https://calendar.lancaster
 libraries.org/event/swoon-squad-romance-tbr-book-club-176857\n\nAdding thi
